-- P12 DB fill-ins (section 4): vendor items and spell-summoned objects SkyFire's DB lacks, from the Legends of Azeroth
-- Pandaria 5.4.8 world DB (GPL v2, 2024-07-22). Safe to run twice (INSERT IGNORE; npc_vendor's key is entry, item,
-- ExtendedCost, type). Only rows whose creature and item exist here and whose ExtendedCost is in ItemExtendedCost.db2.
-- LoA's 7,820 extra item templates are all deprecated items the 5.4.8 client doesn't have (not in Item-sparse.db2),
-- so none are imported.

